    "name": "links in the root (to a file outside, to a folder outside, to /, dangling, a loop) are never followed: their bytes never reach the drive, each is listed",
    "description": "JOTTA-027 (Jottacloud): the client followed symlinks on HFS+ drives. Rules S1 (links in the root are inert: never followed, listed and skipped by default) and O1. sync-chaos sec-symlink-out-file.",
